.IX Title "PGP-FIXKEY 1"
.TH PGP-FIXKEY 1 2024-07-13 "perl v5.38.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pgp\-fixkey \-\- remove broken packets from keys
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.IP "\fBpgp-fixkey\fR [\fIkeyid\fR [\fIkeyid\fR ...]]" 4
.IX Item "pgp-fixkey [keyid [keyid ...]]"
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBpgp-fixkey\fR removes broken packets from keys in the GnuPG keyring that make
GnuPG spew ugly warnings.  It optionally takes a list of keyids on the command
line and only cleans those keys.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP \fIkeyid\fR 4
.IX Item "keyid"
Use this key.
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
.IP \fIHOME\fR 4
.IX Item "HOME"
The default home directory.
.IP \fIGNUPGBIN\fR 4
.IX Item "GNUPGBIN"
The gpg binary.  Default: \f(CW"gpg"\fR.
.IP \fIGNUPGHOME\fR 4
.IX Item "GNUPGHOME"
The default working directory for gpg.  Default: \f(CW\*(C`$HOME/.gnupg\*(C'\fR.
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
.IX Header "FILES"
.ie n .IP "$HOME/.gnupg/pubring.gpg  \-  default GnuPG keyring" 4
.el .IP "\f(CW$HOME\fR/.gnupg/pubring.gpg  \-  default GnuPG keyring" 4
.IX Item "$HOME/.gnupg/pubring.gpg - default GnuPG keyring"
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBcaff\fR\|(1), \fBgpg\fR\|(1).
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.IX Header "AUTHOR"
Peter Palfrader <peter@palfrader.org>
